    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Station Project</strong> is a game that lets you step into the role of a train station manager. Start with simple tasks like renovation and ticket sales. Over time, you'll offer a variety of services and manage your own staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Renovation</strong> - Clean up a run-down station building, get rid of accumulated junk, replace floors, paint walls and repair damaged equipment. A well-maintained building will attract more customers and generate more profit from the services you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/7938b8782ef3202629082e24f9c61b8c.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/7938b8782ef3202629082e24f9c61b8c.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/7938b8782ef3202629082e24f9c61b8c.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve customers</strong> - Start by selling tickets to increase the range of services offered over time. Open a point for sending and receiving mail packages and a lost and found office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/2eb6d25c852484fc0fb13f7782e49410.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/2eb6d25c852484fc0fb13f7782e49410.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/2eb6d25c852484fc0fb13f7782e49410.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Additional Businesses</strong> - Your station is not just about ticket sales! The usable area of the building increases with each upgrade. Open your own shop, set up vending machines, and even create an arcade room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/0fa221473c4a06e6abff4cad37289fcb.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/0fa221473c4a06e6abff4cad37289fcb.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/0fa221473c4a06e6abff4cad37289fcb.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employees</strong> - Over time, the number of activities will grow, and you'll need to consider hiring staff. Invest in employee housing to expand your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/07113f76ca07059ce36abe5d35f7b265.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/07113f76ca07059ce36abe5d35f7b265.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/07113f76ca07059ce36abe5d35f7b265.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> - Remember that your resources are not infinite. You need to take care of your warehouse and regularly plan to order products for the store, vending machines and even things for your office. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trains!</strong> - In addition to observing passing passenger trains, you can earn extra cash by performing cleaning service tasks on train cars. You can skip these assignments, but over time, your permissions will increase to more responsible roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/455a8539da2b125baffb1ab5feb3e160.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/455a8539da2b125baffb1ab5feb3e160.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/455a8539da2b125baffb1ab5feb3e160.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Station Project</strong> is a game that lets you step into the role of a train station manager. Start with simple tasks like renovation and ticket sales. Over time, you'll offer a variety of services and manage your own staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Renovation</strong> - Clean up a run-down station building, get rid of accumulated junk, replace floors, paint walls and repair damaged equipment. A well-maintained building will attract more customers and generate more profit from the services you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/7938b8782ef3202629082e24f9c61b8c.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/7938b8782ef3202629082e24f9c61b8c.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/7938b8782ef3202629082e24f9c61b8c.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve customers</strong> - Start by selling tickets to increase the range of services offered over time. Open a point for sending and receiving mail packages and a lost and found office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/2eb6d25c852484fc0fb13f7782e49410.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/2eb6d25c852484fc0fb13f7782e49410.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/2eb6d25c852484fc0fb13f7782e49410.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Additional Businesses</strong> - Your station is not just about ticket sales! The usable area of the building increases with each upgrade. Open your own shop, set up vending machines, and even create an arcade room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/0fa221473c4a06e6abff4cad37289fcb.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/0fa221473c4a06e6abff4cad37289fcb.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/0fa221473c4a06e6abff4cad37289fcb.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employees</strong> - Over time, the number of activities will grow, and you'll need to consider hiring staff. Invest in employee housing to expand your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/07113f76ca07059ce36abe5d35f7b265.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/07113f76ca07059ce36abe5d35f7b265.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/07113f76ca07059ce36abe5d35f7b265.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> - Remember that your resources are not infinite. You need to take care of your warehouse and regularly plan to order products for the store, vending machines and even things for your office. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trains!</strong> - In addition to observing passing passenger trains, you can earn extra cash by performing cleaning service tasks on train cars. You can skip these assignments, but over time, your permissions will increase to more responsible roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/455a8539da2b125baffb1ab5feb3e160.poster.avif?t=1754947056\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/455a8539da2b125baffb1ab5feb3e160.webm?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681560/extras/455a8539da2b125baffb1ab5feb3e160.mp4?t=1754947056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
